== Summary ==
Numbered Virtual Set #1a PDF distributed through Decipher. Dark Side text is white on black. This is distinct from the earlier unnumbered #1a PDF on the PC resource server. PDF creation metadata records 6 March 2002; tournament legality is 9 March. Original PDF bytes retained.

